1
00:00:01,150 --> 00:00:04,212
14 months. Not
because of my code.

2
00:00:04,242 --> 00:00:05,520
I was getting better.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:06,771
So I stopped.

4
00:00:06,801 --> 00:00:08,720
And treated it like a project.

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:10,556
I looked at where
I actually fit,

6
00:00:10,586 --> 00:00:12,112
and where I didn't yet.

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,014
Every draft tailored.

8
00:00:15,044 --> 00:00:17,820
My words. Nothing
saved without me.

9
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,797
The gap's still on my résumé.

10
00:00:19,827 --> 00:00:22,229
It's just not the
headline anymore.

